
# 📦 Biological Data Retrieval Module

This directory serves as the master data retrieval hub for the **Bioinformatics & Molecular Docking** workflow. It consolidates offline biological datasets manually gathered from primary public databases (**NCBI**, **PDB**, and **UniProt**) to support sequence parsing, structural analysis, and docking prep pipelines.

---

## 📁 Directory Structure & Contents

```text
Data-Retrieval/
├── NCBI_Data_Retrieval/       # Nucleotide (mRNA/genomes) and Protein sequence datasets
├── PDB_Data_Retrieval/        # 3D structural coordinate files (.pdb) from RCSB PDB
└── Uniprot_Data_Retrieval/    # Curated protein sequence & functional annotation records

```

## 🔬 Submodule Breakdown

### 🧬 [NCBI_Data_Retrieval](https://www.google.com/search?q=./NCBI_Data_Retrieval/)

Contains genomic, transcriptomic, and proteomic sequences manually fetched from the NCBI Entrez databases.

* **`Nucleotide_Sequences/`**: Benchmark DNA and mRNA datasets (*HBB*, *BRCA1*, *GAPDH*, *E. coli*, SARS-CoV-2).
* **`Protein_Sequence/`**: Translated amino acid sequences for functional parsing and primary structure analysis.

### 🏛️ [PDB_Data_Retrieval](https://www.google.com/search?q=./PDB_Data_Retrieval/)

Contains experimental 3D structural data (PDB format) retrieved from the RCSB Protein Data Bank.

* Used for active site mapping, ligand interaction profiling, and preparing macromolecular targets for docking simulations.

### 🌐 [Uniprot_Data_Retrieval](https://www.google.com/search?q=./Uniprot_Data_Retrieval/)

Contains detailed functional annotations, domain mapping, and curated sequence features fetched from UniProtKB.

* Provides high-confidence protein metadata, active site residue locations, and post-translational modification details.

---

## 🛠️ Module Workflow

1. **Data Acquisition:** Fetch raw sequences and structural models from NCBI, PDB, and UniProt.
2. **Offline Processing:** Parse local `.fasta`, `.gb`, `.pdb`, and text files without requiring continuous live API connections.
3. **Pipeline Integration:** Feed clean, verified data into downstream python scripts for feature extraction, alignment, and virtual screening.

